    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a data extraction assistant. Your goal is to extract the company or product where a person is currently working. You have two sources:\n\n1. Job title: {{ $json.title }}\n2. Snippet: {{ $json.snippet }}\nRules:\n1. Prefer the company/product mentioned in the job title. If the title clearly indicates a company (e.g., \"CEO of INVEST'i\"), return that company.\n2. If the title does not contain a company name, try to extract the company from the snippet. Focus on phrases like \"CEO of\", \"founder of\", \"co-founder at\".\n3. Ignore organizations, programs, or supporting entities that are not directly tied to the person's current role.\n4. If multiple companies are mentioned, select only the one directly linked to the person’s current role.\n5. Output only the company/product name as plain text. Do not include any other text.\n6. If unsure, return an empty string.\n7.most importantly only output the company's name in plain text, do not explain the logic\n\nSnippet:\n{{ $json.snippet }}\n\nJob title:\n{{ $json.title }}",
        "options": {}
      },
